{"id":68569,"date":"2025-08-29T08:24:37","date_gmt":"2025-08-29T07:24:37","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=68569"},"modified":"2026-10-01T22:48:46","modified_gmt":"2026-10-01T21:48:46","slug":"trail-entre-vinhas-e-o-mondego","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-entre-vinhas-e-o-mondego\/","title":{"rendered":"1\u00ba Trail entre Vinhas e o Mondego 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">1\u00ba Trail entre Vinhas e o Mondego 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>1\u00ba Trail entre Vinhas e o Mondego 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>15 de Novembro de 2026<\/strong> (Domingo), com partidas a partir das <strong>09:00<\/strong> em <strong>Vila Nova de Tazem<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Gouveia<\/strong>, distrito da <strong>Guarda<\/strong>. A prova convida os atletas a percorrer caminhos rurais, vinhedos e as margens do rio Mondego num ambiente desportivo e festivo.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa contempla a prova competitiva de <strong>Trail Curto de 16 km<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s 09:00) e uma <strong>Caminhada de 8 km<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s 09:30), ambas com almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio inclu\u00eddo. A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza abastecimentos regulares, cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica de tempos, oferta de meias t\u00e9cnicas e seguro desportivo.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A realiza\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 a cargo do <strong>CCD de Vila Nova de Tazem<\/strong> em parceria com a <strong>Junta de Freguesia de Vila Nova de Tazem<\/strong>, com o compromisso de assegurar uma experi\u00eancia desportiva segura e acolhedora para todos os participantes.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: bloc